# W31, b (k10): joins a in stag0201 by the gate; when a went into dng204b1 alone b sees the notice and answers at once
# (the box's A after the notice's half second): its request waits while dng204b1 loads and its entry scene runs ("Going
# along when Kim's floor is ready..."), b plays on in stag0201; then its GO departure and the join at dng204b1's entrance.
# b stays at B1's entrance when a goes on to B2.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail stagechange
log b sees the notice
idle until frames>=40
goalong until go=waiting or go=stamped or go=going
log b asked to go along
idle until stage=dng204b1,present=2,sealed>=120 fail epoch>=@1000
log b joined a in dng204b1
idle until present=1 fail epoch>=@1700,stage=stagml11
log a went on without b
idle until frames>=600
